flowchart TD
  Request[Record submission] --> Find[Resolve user and level]
  Find --> Save[Persist submitted record]
  Save --> Validate[Record validation service]
  Validate --> Eligibility[Update record eligibility]
  Eligibility -->|eligible| Project[Update record statistics and score projections]
  Eligibility -->|failed validation| Keep[Retain record as ineligible evidence]
  Project --> History[Update history and counts as required]
  Keep --> Read[Read services filter by eligibility]
  History --> Read
